<title>USA: American Israeli set cash dividend.</title>
<headline>American Israeli set cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yearly</p>
<p>			  Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $4.20		     $1.04</p>
<p> Pay		December 3</p>
<p> Record	  November 18</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is American Israeli Paper Mills Ltd.</p>
<p>The rate of exchange, shekel vs US dollar, on the record date will determine the exact amount of the dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend reflects capital gains to the company due to the venture of Hogla and Kimberly-Clark.</p>
</text>
